Dear group - I'm so happy to say that I finally - after struggling with this for months - figured out what the problem was. In my inputdata-table, clay_silt_fsand_Adata.txt, I had all my soil sample lab data with all the predictors extracted for each point. One of the categories from that fgjord raster did not exist in the table. It was a code for bedrock that only exist on one of the islands of Denmark, and surely we hadn't collected soil samples in these positions :). When predicting the final raster, R crashed because of this. Would your suggestion take care of it? I'm sorry - this is my first attempt with R, but now I know why it doesn't work and that is half the solution. Thanks for all your suggestions

/Mette

