Dear Marina,

you can do predictions only for primary structural parameters of the model (I believe). The vector "psi" is such a parameter only in the first year, after that, the psi's are functions of other parameters (of psi in the first year and all the extinction and colonisation params leading up to a year). So if you want to get 95% CIs for psi in the 2 until the last year, you have to use the bootstrap.

Kind regards  --  Marc

